name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q5_2025'

question 'On a coffee shop app, each time you add a drink to your cart, the total number of items at the top of the screen increases. What is the app using to keep track of how many drinks you\'ve added?'

right 'A variable that stores and updates the total each time you add a drink'
wrong 'A color code that changes the text whenever you make a purchase'
wrong 'A font style that highlights the most popular menu items'
wrong 'A download counter that measures how many people use the app'

allow_multiple_attempts false

